   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress Toward Outcome: A. Policy-based loan (PBL) component: ADY has undertaken thorough and comprehensive corporate, financial, and commercial reforms, enabling the organization to improve rail service delivery and the financial viability of railway operations in Azerbaijan. ADY achieved the PBL outputs (i) management and financial autonomy enhanced, (ii) financial restructuring of ADY debt liabilities effectively conducted, (iii) financial and management control, efficiency and reporting at ADY enhanced, and (iv) operational efficiency enhanced and corporate restructuring effectively conducted. In sector reform, ADY is a forerunner in the region and has implemented major changes vigorously. ADY&apos;s continuous commitment and perseverance to improve performance are highly commendable and provide important experience for other railway agencies in the regions.

B. Project loan component: As of Q1 2025, construction progress reached (i) Lot 1 = 87% and (ii) Lot 2 = 81%. Mainline track laid = approximately 97% (weighted).</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
